   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "Out in the backyard, Max and Kostya, the bartender, are staring at the goose. Neither of them can bring themselves to kill it, and a few silly ideas fail. Desperate, Max goes to Ainura and asks for help. Here is the conversation in Russian first.",
   "gap": 0.8
  },
